link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-a3b30fea8ae15cf2END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-b454ade2d44154dcEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BloodMerchant_ChosensBlood</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BloodMerchant_ChosensBlood\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BloodMerchant_ChosensBlood\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">5197bb23-e976-486b-a25e-b6c8d0334e05</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5197bb23-e976-486b-a25e-b6c8d0334e05\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5197bb23-e976-486b-a25e-b6c8d0334e05\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Sanguine_Laboratory\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sanguine Laboratory\">Sanguine Laboratory</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1861&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-430</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Gortash... what a specimen. I wonder about you... The wizard <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Irenicus\">Irenicus</a> managed to adopt the Slayer by imbibing the Divine Essence of a God's child, tricking <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a> into thinking the wizard was one of his own.\n</p><p><br>\nIf I managed to imbibe the blood of this Enver Gortash, could Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(deity)\" title=\"Bane (deity)\">Bane</a> be tricked into descending his powers onto me? To think I am Chosen?\n</p><p><br>\nI shall tell Lord Gortash who I am: that soon I shall command an army in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Menzoberranzan\">Menzoberranzan</a> and be an eligible daughter of its most powerful House.\n</p><p><br>\nI shall write a proposal, offering alliance... in exchange for a consistent supply of Baneite blood.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Although none of what Araj is proposing in this note actually happens in-game, what she is proposing is <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_references_to_previous_Baldur%27s_Gate_games\" title=\"List of references to previous Baldur's Gate games\">a direct reference</a> to the events of Baldur's Gate II: Shadows of Amn.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202559\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1639/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32330/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9573/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930552/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.220      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.220      1 -total\n 55.57%   23.461      7 Template:Icon_text\n 49.60%   20.942     17 Template:Trim\n 22.16%    9.356      2 Template:Uid\n 14.64%    6.182      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.80%    5.825      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.91%    5.451      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.00%    4.643      1 Template:Books\n 10.61%    4.479      7 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35128-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202559 and revision id 394550. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}